        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_14bf70b807f1405e9204b91987336eb2",
      "statement": "`ComparisonPageBuilder` is a library-only report assembler: it reads the eval `metrics.json`, optionally parses the training runs' `metrics.csv` for `val/fid` and `val/mean_reward` through the shared `MetricsPlotCallback._read_series` (which drops non-finite values), embeds every curve and slice grid as a base64 PNG data URI with no external image, stylesheet, or script references, explains the JiT-reference-free versus ControlNet-full-reference metric split in the page opener, renders a clearly marked pending slot when no ControlNet eval directory is supplied, and writes `out_path` atomically.",
      "evidence": [
