    {
      "id": "claim_4e7fad7f08be49b497c41c8cce8e97d9",
      "statement": "ADR-0037's in-training paired-fidelity monitor is implemented and default-on for `manifold-train-controlnet`, and it shares the offline contract — the same metric, the same `min_max_to_unit` normalization, and the same full Heun rollout — so the in-training `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` curve is directly comparable to the offline number; it remains observe-only, leaving checkpoint selection on `val/x0_mae` and contributing nothing to loss or gradient.",
      "evidence": [
