    {
      "id": "claim_00d25a8e55534b09aa476d2657e50af0",
      "statement": "The remaining open follow-up is the ControlNet-GRPO extension of that monitor: the GRPO shell registers only `train_loss`, `fid`, and `checkpoint` and forbids the `fid` callback plus the `val/fid` monitor on the ControlNet path, and ADR-0037 defers the paired-fidelity extension there to a separate ticket or ADR because the FID rationale (an unconditional rollout ignoring the ControlNet) does not cover the trainable-ControlNet paired rollout.",
      "evidence": [
